{'symbol': 'ODFL', 'date': '2021-09-07 08:40:00', 'title': 'OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE PROVIDES UPDATE FOR THIRD-QUARTER 2021', 'text': 'THOMASVILLE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--OLD DOMINION FREIGHT LINE, INC. (NASDAQ: ODFL) TODAY REPORTED CERTAIN LESS-THAN-TRUCKLOAD (“LTL”) OPERATING METRICS FOR AUGUST 2021. REVENUE PER DAY INCREASED 29.1% AS COMPARED TO AUGUST 2020 DUE TO A 10.9% INCREASE IN LTL TONS PER DAY AND AN INCREASE IN LTL REVENUE PER HUNDREDWEIGHT. THE CHANGE IN LTL TONS PER DAY WAS ATTRIBUTABLE TO A 17.3% INCREASE IN LTL SHIPMENTS PER DAY THAT WAS PARTIALLY OFFSET BY A 5.5% DECREASE IN LTL WEIGHT PER SHIPMENT. FOR THE QUA'}